From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 01:25:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lane-299 WIP: vulkan HC_POST_W fusion
 (SCALE->SIGMOID->SCALE->DSV4_HC_POST, one dispatch)

qwen4exp build_hc_combine scatter weights fused into the hc_post shader (FUSE_W spec constant). Off switch GGML_VK_DISABLE_HC_POST_W; selfcheck plant GGML_VK_HC_POST_W_PLANT; graph_optimize keeps the pattern adjacent; test-backend-ops DSV4_HC_POST_W. UNBUILT at commit time (GPU-TIMED hold).

Lane: lane-299
(cherry picked from commit 6db5300cc1f78afadf64b0b9b558400fc3da5005)
(cherry picked from commit 0bff1be8c16983cdc82af44051cc9c64c587496a)

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - fork-authored (lane-299); no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: part of win W11, HC_POST_W fusion (SCALE->SIGMOID->SCALE->DSV4_HC_POST in one dispatch): ABBA, 2 runs per arm: short 10.692 -> 10.828 (+1.2%), long 9.935 -> 10.599 (+6.6%), ids 8/8, -288 dispatches/token; fusion-x1-lane/cells/ab2-10050243-verdict.json (tps read and recomputed; state head 39d218e83d, which contains 6db5300cc1) [release ledger Table 1 W11]
